+`path:N` past the end of its file is a citation whose code moved without it.
+```
+
+### Step 6: 跑，看它通過
+
+```
+node --test tests/todo-check.test.js
+node scripts/todo-check.js
+```
+
+預期：測試全綠；repo 自己的 TODO.md exit 0。
+
+### Step 7: Commit
+
+```
+git add scripts/docs-check.js scripts/todo-check.js tests/todo-check.test.js TODO.md
+git commit -m "feat: todo-check reports a path:line past the end of its file"
+```
